sequenceDiagram
    participant Bundle as Existing MJS Bundle
    participant Parser as AST Parser
    participant Analyzer as Semantic Analyzer
    participant Modules as Module Recovery
    participant Types as Type Recovery
    participant Builder as Builder
    participant Diff as Differential Test Harness

    Bundle->>Parser: Read immutable bytes and SHA-256
    Parser->>Analyzer: AST, ranges, imports, exports, declarations
    Analyzer->>Modules: Calls, strings, security and third-party clusters
    Modules->>Types: Evidence-backed module and type candidates
    Types->>Builder: Canonical src/browser-client modules
    Builder->>Diff: Bun candidate artifacts
    Bundle->>Diff: Baseline exports, protocol and behavior snapshots
    Diff-->>Analyzer: Review mismatches and confidence
